  "notes": "Same Log Now / Wi-Fi-conflict fix as the BLE command, applied to the Wi-Fi field console (field_console.py) too: new /log page posts one Power_Log row over cellular (prefer_wifi=False -- the console's own Wi-Fi AP is already using the radio, so trying Wi-Fi STA here risks dropping the very AP connection you're viewing the page over). Also fixes the console's pre-existing /ota page, which had the same latent conflict now that ota.py prefers Wi-Fi by default. /log reuses ble_service.read_status() instead of duplicating INA260/INA219 reads.",
